==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[átta]]'' "[[eight]]". Meaning '''twenty and eight'''.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# '''[[twenty-eight]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tuttugu og sjö#Icelandic|tuttugu og sjö]] and before [[tuttugu og níu#Icelandic|tuttugu og níu]].

